  "difficulty": "medium",
  "summary": "作者以武曲属金解释肺经及呼吸系统的疾病象征，并举盘十五：武曲天府在子，火星擎羊同踞，壬年武曲化忌使火克金而忌煞交冲。作者称不论子宫是哪一事项宫均可能有关病变；这是来源命理观点而非医学诊断。后半排盘与正文乱序保留，不重构。",
  "summary_en": "The author associates Military Melody metal with lung-meridian and respiratory illness. In Chart Fifteen, Military Melody and Heavenly Treasury occupy Zi with Fire Star and Ram Blade. For a Ren-year birth, Military Melody’s Obstruction Transformation is said to activate fire overcoming metal and malefic affliction. The author claims possible respiratory or lung-meridian problems regardless of Zi’s functional palace. These are attributed astrological claims, not medical diagnoses. The following disordered chart and prose are excluded from usable evidence.",
